# Project is set to Force Text serialization (ProjectSettings/EditorSettings.asset,
# m_SerializationMode: 2), so ScriptableObject .asset files are YAML. Jazztures'
# own assets (event channels, tuning config, lesson data) must stay diffable and
# mergeable for review — keep them out of LFS. Third-party/boilerplate .asset files
# elsewhere still match the rule above.
Assets/Jazztures/**/*.asset text !filter !diff !merge
Assets/Tests/**/*.asset text !filter !diff !merge
